<title>JAPAN: BOXING-CHOI RETAINS WBA JUNIOR LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-CHOI RETAINS WBA JUNIOR LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean Choi Yong-soo had a unanimous points win over Yamato Mitani of Japan on Sunday to retain his World Boxing Association (WBA) junior lightweight crown.</p>
</text>
